<div class="cl-title">客户「姜彦博」｜陈舒｜整组 96 条 · 三段标注</div>
<div class="cl-sub">这一段共 96 条，图片与表情消息 22 条略过，其余逐条排下来。色条与标签只标一件事：这句话在完成哪一项。</div>
<div class="cl-legend"><span class="cl-lg"><i style="background:#2563EB"></i><b style="color:#2563EB">①形态</b><em>我买的是什么</em></span><span class="cl-lg"><i style="background:#0E9F6E"></i><b style="color:#0E9F6E">②出口</b><em>买完能得到什么</em></span><span class="cl-lg"><i style="background:#D97706"></i><b style="color:#D97706">③落点</b><em>跟我有什么关系</em></span></div>
<div class="cl-body">
<div class="cl-time"><span>10月15日 09:20</span></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">哈喽哈喽</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">请问咱是单纯自我提升还是有打算做教练呀</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">做教练</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">咱之前是练了多久啦</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">了解一下基础</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">快一年了吧</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">可以啊</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">基础这么好</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">不过这个涉及到考证哦</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">咱有了解过这些证书的区别啵</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">我提前整理了一个笔记~咱瞅瞅</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">还没去了解</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">1</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">不过有学生说我电脑发出来看不着，手机发出来可以[流泪]</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">咱看能正常用啵</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">能</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">好好好，对啦咱们怎么称呼呀</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">咱是几几年滴涅</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">姜彦博</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">05</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">00后健身意识就是强啊</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">弟弟咱是温州那边的啵</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">我看电话是那</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">是的</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">以后还是到那边发展啵</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">还是杭州啊啥的</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-band" style="background:#FFF4DF;border-left-color:#D97706;color:#D97706">③ 落点 · 客户说都可以看就业，就按他的城市、证书、体型来推荐</div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k="3"><div class="cl-chips"><span class="cl-chip" style="background:#D97706">③落点</span></div><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#D97706"></i><span class="cl-txt">都可以，看就业怎么样</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k="3"><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#D97706"></i><span class="cl-txt">因为一线超一线这种城市好点的单位都会要求国际认证</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k="3"><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#D97706"></i><span class="cl-txt">国际认证会贵一些</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k="3"><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#D97706"></i><span class="cl-txt">主要咱推荐就业的时候也是根据</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k="3"><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#D97706"></i><span class="cl-txt">咱想去的城市、</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k="3"><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#D97706"></i><span class="cl-txt">持有的证书、体型去推荐的</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">弟弟大学学滴啥专业呀</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">建筑工程</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">纳尼</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">好家伙</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">自己喜欢的嘛</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">是的</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">弟弟实习的时候试了下这个行业不</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">建筑</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">有啊，实习了半年</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">坏了忘了正事，光顾着唠嗑了[害羞]</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-band" style="background:#E8EFFF;border-left-color:#2563EB;color:#2563EB">① 形态 · 一句话三件套：三个月集训 + 九个月线上 + 两年复训</div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k="1"><div class="cl-chips"><span class="cl-chip" style="background:#2563EB">①形态</span></div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#2563EB"></i><span class="cl-txt">弟弟这是咱们课程大纲</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k="1"><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#2563EB"></i><span class="cl-txt">线下系统学习课程是线下三个月集训＋九个月线上课＋两年内一次免费复训的权益</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k="1"><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#2563EB"></i><span class="cl-txt">组成</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">费用是多少呢</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">弟弟之前带过人练啵</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">没有</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">那吃住是怎么样的</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">我找了一个学生录的视频来着，教练的工作内容大概是这样~</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">（引“那吃住是怎么样的”）离咱最近的校区是南京跟长沙</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">如果两种环境咱都能接受我还是比较推荐咱长沙校区</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">我跟刚哥都在这边~</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">有个照应，再加上弟弟以后如果做自媒体的话，体德跟刚哥本身就是流量</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">咱平时管得还是蛮严的嗷</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">不过咱整体时长还是有那么久，有跟爸妈商量过考虑转行啵</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">一个班有多少人呀</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">30-45人</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">这几个月人会少点[嘿哈]</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg c" data-who="姜彦博" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">姜彦博</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">几号开始上课</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-nm">陈舒</div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">最近的班是21号滴</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">还有一个名额</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">长沙</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">南京是28号</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">都差不多年前一点点结束</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">咱们这上边有对上的啵</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-band" style="background:#E6F9F1;border-left-color:#0E9F6E;color:#0E9F6E">② 出口 · 就业讲成时间线：课程第四阶段就教包装，毕业后 1/3/6 个月回访</div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k="2"><div class="cl-chips"><span class="cl-chip" style="background:#0E9F6E">②出口</span></div><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#0E9F6E"></i><span class="cl-txt">对啦还有一个板块没讲</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k="2"><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#0E9F6E"></i><span class="cl-txt">就业</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k="2"><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#0E9F6E"></i><span class="cl-txt">咱就业方面的帮助首先体现在课程设置上，第四阶段着重教咱怎么营销自己包装自己以及授课和转化技巧嘛，期间班主任和就业老师会帮忙拍摄形象照和制作简历（会p），毕业前会安排体验课，由我们工作人员/新生去扮演会员，咱来尝试转化这个会员，在校内查漏补缺</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k="2"><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:#0E9F6E"></i><span class="cl-txt">就业咱是推荐就业的形式，根据咱想去的城市、证书、体型去推荐，有体德学生在的地方、一线优先推荐，就业之后还没完等咱毕业之后，第一、三、六个月都会有就业老师定期地去回访，了解学生现在的薪资状况以及就业的状态，招生老师每年都会跟进自己的学生[呲牙]，像6.19号体德8周年家宴邀请了历来的体德毕业生去西湖楼吃饭，安排了咱工作人员了解学生近况，体德对毕业生也很重视~不是推进去之后就不管啦[转圈]</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-time"><span>10月22日 14:00</span></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">哈喽哈喽下午好呀弟弟</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">咱不是之前有考虑过做教练嘛</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">有了解过教练的薪资结构和淡旺季啵</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-msg s" data-who="陈舒" data-k=""><div class="cl-bub"><i class="cl-bar" style="background:transparent"></i><span class="cl-txt">咱们了解行业不能只看好的一面嘛</span></div></div>
<div class="cl-note">【结论】姜彦博：落点靠「按你想去的城市、证书、体型推荐」立住，但建筑工程实习半年这条最硬的事实被自己掐断，全程也没报出一个数字。</div>
</div>
</div></div><i class="cl-fade" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
